   <narrative xml:lang="SV">Insatsen f&#xf6;r metodbaserade kurser/workshops faller inom ramen f&#xf6;r     strategin kapacitetsutveckling och samverkan och s&#xe5;dana               kurser/workshops &#xe4;r d&#xe4;rtill efterfr&#xe5;gade av Sida Partnership Forums   prim&#xe4;ra m&#xe5;lgrupper, personal inom myndigheter, civilsamh&#xe4;llets        organisationer etc som utg&#xf6;r det svenska bist&#xe5;ndets                   samarbetspartners.</narrative>
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">The contribution for training in methods is in line with the          government strategy for capacity development and cooperation, and     such trainings/workshops are also in direct demand from the primary   target groups of Sida Partnership Forum, i.e. Swedish government      agencies, civil society organisations etc.</narrative>
